# Third-Party Model Licenses

This project evaluates the third-party models listed below. They are the
property of their respective owners and are released under the licenses
stated in their repositories; the MIT license above applies only to this
project's own code. Several models are gated on HuggingFace and require
accepting their terms before download.

| Model | Used as | License | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| GroundingDINO | Detector (`IDEA-Research/grounding-dino-base`, `rziga/mm_grounding_dino_large_all`) | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/IDEA-Research/GroundingDINO |
| SAM3 | Detector (`facebook/sam3`) | SAM License (custom, Meta) | https://huggingface.co/facebook/sam3 |
| OWL-ViT | Detector (`google/owlvit-large-patch14`) | Apache-2.0 | https://huggingface.co/google/owlvit-large-patch14 |
| YOLOv5 | Detector engine via `torch.hub` (`ultralytics/yolov5`) | AGPL-3.0 | https://github.com/ultralytics/yolov5 |
| Ultralytics (YOLOv8 engine) | Detector engine for FlatBug / InsectsDCT weights | AGPL-3.0 | https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics |
| DINOv2 | Embedding extractor (`facebookresearch/dinov2`) | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2 |
| DINOv3 | Embedding extractor (`facebook/dinov3-vith16plus-pretrain-lvd1689m`) | DINOv3 License (custom, Meta) | https://huggingface.co/facebook/dinov3-vith16plus-pretrain-lvd1689m |
| BioCLIP-2 | Embedding extractor (`imageomics/bioclip-2`) | MIT | https://huggingface.co/imageomics/bioclip-2 |
| BioCLIP-2.5 | Embedding extractor (`imageomics/bioclip-2.5-vith14`) | MIT | https://huggingface.co/imageomics/bioclip-2.5-vith14 |
| EUPE (ViT-B/16) | Optional embedding extractor (local checkpoint) | See the EUPE repository's own license | Local checkout (`EUPE_REPO_DIR`) |

Notes:

- The fine-tuned YOLO weights used as supervised baselines (Bjerge2023,
  Stark2023, Marin2025, FlatBug, InsectsDCT) are derived from YOLOv5/YOLOv8
  and distributed by their authors; their download sources are listed in
  `MODEL_WEIGHTS.md`. As derivatives of AGPL-3.0 code, redistribution of
  those weights or of services built on them may be subject to AGPL-3.0
  terms.
- Meta's SAM and DINOv3 licenses are custom, non-standard agreements
  (research and commercial use permitted, redistribution under the same
  license, attribution in publications, no reverse engineering, compliance
  with export controls and sanctions). They are not compatible with
  re-licensing under MIT.
- The `example_dataset/` images are camera-trap samples used for
  demonstration; their terms are not covered by this file.

- The `example_dataset/` images are camera-trap samples used for
  demonstration only. They are not covered by the MIT license above and
  are released under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (Attribution-NonCommercial-
  ShareAlike): non-commercial use only, with attribution and
  share-alike obligations.